# Roca One is a commercial typeface. A webfont licence covers serving it from
# your own site, but NOT redistributing the files — and this repo is public, so
# committing them would publish the font to anyone who clones or forks.
# The site still needs them at deploy time; see README for the options.
RocaOne-LtIt.ttf
RocaOne.woff
RocaOne.woff2
